{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30417","headline":"献淮南李仆射 · 赵嘏","name":"献淮南李仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早年曾谒富民侯，今日难甘失鹄羞。\n新诺似山无力负，旧恩如水满身流。\n马嘶红叶萧萧晚，日照长江灩灩秋。\n功德万重知不惜，一言抛得百生愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}